				<r3d:description language="eng">IDEM is an interdisciplinary and multifaceted database of manuscripts and printed books that are relevant to the Alamire Foundation&#039;s research and activities. It therefore especially focuses on the musical heritage of the Low Countries from the early Middle Ages until 1800. IDEM is designed to be an online, freely accessible platform and tool for the preservation, study, and valorisation of the music heritage of the Low Countries.</r3d:description>
